WP4 is done. The guardian flow works in demo: sign in → add a player → edit → report card → CSV/JSON download → delete player → sign out.

**Screens:** `/login`, `/signup`, `/forgot`, `/verify`, `/who` (with a grown-up math gate), `/family` (settings, class-play toggles, delete account), add/edit player by invite code, `/family/report?player=`, and `/privacy`. Report cards, CSV/JSON, and “I saw it” practice confirms all go through `actions.js`. `wixRepo` now pages events and batch-inserts instead of one query per event.

**Checked:** `npm run build` and `npm test` pass, `node test/e2e/demo-smoke.mjs http://localhost:4404` printed `SMOKE OK`, and 1440/390 shots are in `screenshots/wp4/`. Write-up is `agents/reports/WP4.md` (including what still needs a real Wix client ID). Not pushed.

